{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "58a6499f-f039-8dbf-80cc-b929903297dc",
  "created_at": "2026-01-06T08:47:46-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Zoning and Inspections",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Terrence Dolan",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Greg Lombardi",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T08:45:05-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zoning and Inspections, this is Greg."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T08:45:08-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning, Greg. Please excuse me for the bother. My name is Terrence Dolan, and I have a question about a fence."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T08:45:16-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, go ahead. Is this for a property in Newport?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T08:45:20-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please, it is a rental house I own, at 407 Ocean Avenue, on the Ocean Drive side. The tenants have a little vegetable garden in the back, and the deer come and eat everything. So I want to put up a fence to keep them out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T08:45:36-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. What kind of fence are you thinking?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T08:45:39-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Please, let me tell you what I planned. It is black aluminum, five feet tall. I think that is high enough, no? Or maybe the deer jump it, I do not know."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T08:45:50-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Five feet is what a lot of people go with. I can't promise what a deer will do. What's your actual question for me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T08:45:58-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Excuse me, yes. My question is, do I need a permit to build the fence? Or is it only for the big ones?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T08:46:06-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "In general, yes, a fence usually needs a permit here. Height and location matter, but you should plan on applying before you put anything in the ground."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T08:46:15-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ah, I see. Then, please, one more thing. Do I need a survey of the land? I thought the permit was only a paper from the city, and now you say a survey also?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T08:46:27-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I didn't say you need a survey, I said you'd need a permit. Whether a survey's required, or just a plan showing where the fence sits on the lot, that's what the permit application will spell out. If you have an old plot plan from when you bought it, hang onto that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T08:46:44-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I am sorry, I misunderstood. So the plot plan, it is the same as the survey? Or different?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T08:46:51-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sometimes they're the same thing, sometimes not. A survey is done by a surveyor. A plot plan can be a simpler drawing of the lot. Come by the office or look at the application and it'll tell you which one they want."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T08:47:05-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, I will do that. Please forgive my questions, I am not good with these papers. At home I only crochet. Small animals, you know. I am halfway through an octopus right now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T08:47:16-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, good luck with the octopus. So, stop by or pick up the fence application, bring whatever lot drawing you've got, and the staff can tell you what's missing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T08:47:26-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I will come this week. So, to be sure, the permit first, then the fence. And the survey, maybe, maybe not."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T08:47:34-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. Permit first, and the application will say if you need the survey."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T08:47:39-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you very much, Greg. Please have a good day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T08:47:43-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, Mr. Dolan. Bye now."
    }
  ],
